window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I'M THE ALPHA OF WOLF RIDGE HIGH.<br> SHE'S THE HUMAN WHO CAN DESTROY ME.</b><br> Nobody knows my secret, the secret that must be kept for me to mate.<br> I've hidden my condition...<br> until <i>she</i> showed up.<br> The delicious-scented human who drives my wolf insane.<br> Being near her makes it a hundred times worse... but I can't resist.<br> I stalk her at school.<br> At home.<br> In bed.<br> If I don't master her soon, my control will snap.<br> But if I don't leave her alone... I'll lose everything.<br> <br> USA Today bestselling author Renee Rose delivers on this intense new adult shifter<br> bully romance.</p>"; 
